No working CRC check implemented yet.

Autocalib to account for frequency drifts.
Right now, values for Carrier Frequency and Baudrate of CC1101 are obtained manually by an auxiliar GNU Radio device as follows:
* Use Universal Radio Hacker (URH) software + extra device, e.g. USRP or RTL, to get carrier frequency and baud rate of Weatherstation
* Set CC1101 to transmit data at obtained settings from previous step and use URH to check offset.
* Tune settings of CC1101 until parameter apper the same on URH (nominal parameter value does not matter and is subject to accuracy of the used hardware for URH)

